Z||000000||rodmcneill||12-27-2000||11:49 PM||||Is the entire exhaust system on the Fiero made of stainless steel? Does this include exhaust manifolds and crossover pipe?||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroJoe||12-28-2000||12:02 AM||||unless someone added on the stainless exhaust to your car, I would have to say no, my exhaust is pretty well rusted.  Though the pipe from the manifold on my L4 to the cat seemed like it could be stainless, the rest was not.  I dont think automakers started putting stainless exhaust on new cars until just recently.....<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||fiero56||12-28-2000||12:29 AM||||Entire exhaust system is stainless(304 I think). It will surface rust, but thats it.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fieroparts.com||12-28-2000||09:04 AM||||all Fieros came with the cheap 409 not the 304 or the aircraft quality 304.||||reg||14
Z||000004||88formula||12-28-2000||08:19 PM||||409 stainless steel will surface rust but it won't rust through.||||reg||1
